I am extremely late getting back to you as these final few weeks of the semester have been so hectic, but you saved my life! Implemented in the game, this looked phenomenal. Participants have had no idea whatsoever that he wasn't dealing real damage!
The plugin was very easy to implement with your advice and I feel more confident to do it in the future. I even was able to tinker around and, with a little trial and error, make it so that this effect only applied to specific spells that he would cast, too.
Your comment about creating too much of a difference between conditions by having Markus heal the player was also incredibly insightful. I talked about it to my advisor, and we ended up changing it so that in the alone condition, players would still receive this healing, but the message would read that they get "a sudden burst of resolve" and restore the HP instead, and Markus simply does the healing in the NPC condition.
Overall, it turned out great, and this thread was a tremendous help.
